# Agora — catalog: categories & products (Sprint 01)
# Run against: dotnet run --project src/Agora.Api  (defaults to http://localhost:5158)
# VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client compatible.
# Endpoints are anonymous in Sprint 01 (auth arrives in Sprint 02).

@host = http://localhost:5158

### List categories (newest first, cursor pagination)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories

### Get one category by slug (slugs are case-insensitive)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories/kitchen-dining

### Unknown category → 404 problem+json
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories/no-such-category

### Malformed slug → 422 problem+json (domain-rule-violated)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories/Not%20A%20Slug

### List products (newest first). Follow the X-Next-Cursor RESPONSE HEADER for the next page.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?limit=5

### Next page (paste the X-Next-Cursor value)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?limit=5&cursor=PASTE_CURSOR_HERE

### Filter products by category slug (the one whitelisted filter param)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?category=home-office

### Get one product by slug
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/cast-iron-skillet-10-inch

### Unknown product → 404 problem+json
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products/no-such-product

### Out-of-range limit → 400 problem+json (rejected, not clamped)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?limit=0

### The OpenAPI document (drift-gated in CI; the React app generates its types from it)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
